WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.800
A sample space is a complete list of all possible results of a fair chance

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.107
experiment.

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.764
List all possible outcomes for a fair coin. The answer is heads, tails. The sample

00:00:10.764 --> 00:00:13.331
space for a fair coin is heads, tails.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.626
A class at a market stall experiments with a numbered six-sided die. Which list has

00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:22.520
all possible outcomes? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:28.609
A class at a market stall experiments with a numbered six-sided die. Which list has

00:00:28.609 --> 00:00:34.549
all possible outcomes? The answer is 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6. The sample space for a

00:00:34.549 --> 00:00:38.044
numbered six-sided die is 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6.
